resolved.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l6 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>A second intermittent issue has =
appeared with the latest kernel upgrade on centos8 causing testsdk to =
fail. This will also likely block M1 as builds fail with the issue and =
we&#8217;d have to disable autobuilder workers to make a release =
build.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l6 level1 =
lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We have a 10th anniversary =
